# procedurally generated placeholder material -- see Item_Photo.obj
# Two materials: PhotoBorder (dark aged-cardboard mount) and PhotoFace
# (lighter sepia print inset). Kd/Ke tuned the same way as the other
# no-texture props this session (Stain_Dirt.mtl etc.) -- this shader
# (unlitTexturePS) only ever shows Kd*(ambient+light)+Ke when there's no
# texture, so a small Ke keeps it visible even in the map's unlit corners.
newmtl PhotoBorder
Ka 1.000000 1.000000 1.000000
Kd 0.180000 0.140000 0.100000
Ks 0.080000 0.080000 0.080000
Ke 0.020000 0.015000 0.010000
Ns 15.000000
d 1.000000
illum 2

newmtl PhotoFace
Ka 1.000000 1.000000 1.000000
Kd 0.620000 0.520000 0.380000
Ks 0.060000 0.060000 0.060000
Ke 0.050000 0.040000 0.030000
Ns 10.000000
d 1.000000
illum 2
